			"notes": "## 0.7.0\n\n### New Features\n\n#### Stopwatch Node\n\n- Added `timer` stopwatch node with multiple control operations:\n  - `START`: Start timing, reset accumulated time to 0\n  - `PAUSE`: Pause timing, save elapsed time\n  - `RESUME`: Resume timing\n  - `STOP`: Stop timing\n  - `RESET`: Reset all states\n- Output ports:\n  - `ELAPSED_TICKS`: Get elapsed ticks (integer)\n  - `ELAPSED_SECONDS`: Get elapsed seconds (float, ticks/20)\n- Timing state stored using node runtime data, supporting multiple independent stopwatch instances\n\n#### Server Commands\n\n- Added `/mgmc openui` server command:\n  - Administrators can remotely open a player's blueprint selection interface\n  - Triggers client UI via `OpenUIPayload` network packet\n  - Requires admin privileges (permission level >= 2)\n\n### Improvements\n\n#### Node Hover Tooltips\n\n- Refactored node hover tooltip system, supporting all node types:\n  - Display node title, category, mod source and other metadata\n  - Adopted modern glassmorphism design style\n  - Improved visual layout and color scheme\n- Added localization keys such as `node_category.mgmc`\n\n#### Marker Node Descriptions\n\n- Added description field support for marker nodes:\n  - Added `description` property to `NodeDefinition`\n  - Added `description()` method to `NodeHelper` for setting node descriptions\n  - Hold `Alt` key while hovering over marker nodes to show description tooltip\n  - Includes node usage instructions and \"Long press [w] to ponder\" hint\n\n### Fixes\n\n#### UI Rendering Layer\n\n- Fixed screen-space UI elements being obscured by nodes and regions\n- Added Z-axis offsets for various UI elements:\n  - Quick search and marker editing: +150\n  - Top toolbar: +100\n  - Node menu and context menu: +250\n  - Notification popups: +300\n  - Settings panel: +400\n- Used `pushPose/popPose` to ensure correct layer nesting\n\n### Localization\n\n- Added Chinese and English localization entries:\n  - `node.mgmc.timer.name`: Stopwatch\n  - `node.mgmc.timer.port.start/pause/resume/stop/reset`: Start/Pause/Resume/Stop/Reset\n  - `node.mgmc.timer.port.elapsed_ticks/elapsed_seconds`: Elapsed Ticks/Elapsed Seconds\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat(control-flow): 新增计时器节点及相关端口常量 by @HelloAIXIAOJI in https://github.com/maingraph-project/for-mc/pull/34\n* THE TOOL TIP by @HelloAIXIAOJI in https://github.com/maingraph-project/for-mc/pull/35\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/maingraph-project/for-mc/compare/v0.6.1...v0.7.0"
		},
