			"notes": "- **New**:\n    - **Call Blueprint (call_blueprint)**: Allows synchronous execution of another blueprint within the current one, passing an argument list and optionally retrieving return values.\n    - **On Blueprint Called (on_blueprint_called)**: Serves as the entry point event for the called blueprint, receiving arguments passed by the caller.\n    - **Return to Caller (return_to_caller)**: Used within the called blueprint to set the result list returned to the caller.\n- **Optimizations & Fixes**:\n    - **Type Conversion Enhancement**: Enhanced `TypeConverter` array conversion capabilities, supporting automatic conversion of Java primitive arrays (String[], int[], etc.) to blueprint lists.\n\n## What's Changed\n* Vfeat/040 by @HelloAIXIAOJI in https://github.com/maingraph-project/for-mc/pull/22\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/maingraph-project/for-mc/compare/v0.3.6...v0.4.0"
